Let guess be number.
Let num be number.
Let tries be number.
Let txt be text.

Set num to 65.
Set guess to -1.
Set tries to 5.

While guess notEqualsTo num and tries greaterThan 0:
	Show "Make a guess (you have ".
	Show tries.
	Show " tries left): ".
	Get number ask "" storeInto guess.
	Show "\n".
	While guess lessThan 0 or guess greaterThan 100:
		Set txt to "Guess should be between 0-100, try again: ".
		Show txt.
		Get number ask "" storeInto guess.
		Show "\n".
	
	If guess equalsTo num then:
		Set txt to "Correct, You got it exactly!\n\n".
	Otherwise if guess lessThan num then:
		Set txt to "The number is greater than your guess\n\n".
	Otherwise:
		Set txt to "The number is lower than your guess\n\n".
	
	Decrease tries by 1.
	Show txt.

If num equalsTo guess then:
	Show "You had ".
	Show tries.
	Show " guesses remaining.".
Otherwise:
	Show "The number was: ".
	Show num.
	Show "\nGood luck next time!".